<title>USA: Peoples finalizes Family buy.</title>
<headline>Peoples finalizes Family buy.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Maine 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples Heritage Financial Group Inc said on Tuesday it finalized the acquisition of Family Bancorp on December 6 1996.</p>
<p>As a result of the acquisition Peoples Heritage is a $5.4 billion banking and financial services company.</p>
<p>Peoples Heritage, headquartered in Portland, Maine, had assets of $4.5 billion prior to the merger with Family Bancorp. Family Bancorp, headquartered in Haverhill, Massachusetts had $925 million in assets before the merger.</p>
</text>
